# Terraform VPC Module

## Overview

Built a reusable Terraform VPC module deploying a production-grade network
across 2 Availability Zones with public and private subnet tiers.

## What Was Built

```
VPC: 10.0.0.0/16 (eu-north-1)
├── public-1a:  10.0.1.0/24   → IGW → Internet
├── public-1b:  10.0.2.0/24   → IGW → Internet
├── private-1a: 10.0.10.0/24  → local only
└── private-1b: 10.0.20.0/24  → local only
```

Resources created: VPC, IGW, 4 subnets, 2 route tables, 4 route table associations.

